## SQ-EFX-08b | oxidized copper armor: Poison duration, read each second (decides SQ-EFX-08)
# bots do not survive a restart; effects still apply to an invulnerable bot
> pbot spawn qe -50 -60 -50
sleep 3
> effect clear qe
> item replace entity qe armor.head with everythingcopper:copper_helmet{state:"oxidized"}
> item replace entity qe armor.chest with everythingcopper:copper_chestplate{state:"oxidized"}
> item replace entity qe armor.legs with everythingcopper:copper_leggings{state:"oxidized"}
> item replace entity qe armor.feet with everythingcopper:copper_boots{state:"oxidized"}
pace 0
repeat 25
sleep 1
> data get entity qe ActiveEffects
end
pace 2
expect Id: 19
look largest Poison Duration about 200 ticks (4 + 3 x 2 s); intervalSeconds 10 in the scratch toml
> clear qe
> effect clear qe

## SQ-DM-03b | mature dandelion drop rate: count drops on the ground and in the inventory (decides SQ-DM-03)
> clear qa
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> tp qa -24 -60 10
> pbot hold qa minecraft:shears
repeat 20
> setblock -20 -60 10 veggiesdelight:mature_dandelion
> pbot use qa -20 -60 10 west
end
sleep 3
> execute positioned -20 -60 10 as @e[type=minecraft:item,distance=..6] run data get entity @s Item
> data get entity qa Inventory
look dandelion items (ground Count sum + inventory) about 10 of 20, leaves 40 to 60; another item id in place of minecraft:dandelion = an item swap
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
